# Secrets
.env

# Data + artifacts
input/*
!input/.gitkeep
output/*
!output/.gitkeep
cache/
*.m4a
*.mp3
*.mp4
*.wav

__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Frozen benchmark runs — untracked in full, deliberately.
#
# Everything under here is derived from one real meeting: quoted sentences,
# a speaker's name bound to a spoken word and a timestamp, word-pair tables.
# None of it is reproducible without the recording, which is rightly not here
# either. The scoring harness lives in scripts/bench/ and runs on your own
# material; what it measured for this project is written up in
# docs/BENCHMARKS.md.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash: an unanchored `bench/` matches at any depth
# and silently swallowed scripts/bench/, the harness itself.
/bench/

# Media that was dropped at the repo root instead of input/
/*.m4a
/*.mp4
